# Testing

| Project | Put here |
|---------|----------|
| `tests/Pilldue.Business.Tests` | Domain rules, planning, services with in-memory ports, `UiLocalizer` key parity, and the WPF project boundary |
| `tests/Pilldue.Data.Tests` | EF repositories, config file, composition, schema |
| `tests/Pilldue.IntegrationTests` | Multi-step flows (add med, refill, skip). No UI |

Run `dotnet test Pilldue.slnx` when the user asks for verification. Do not start a full test run as part of opening a PR (`create-pr`).

- Business tests must not open SQLite.
- Integration tests may use a temp database and `MigrateAsync`.
- A skipped `[Fact(Skip = "...")]` is for a behavior that is specified and not built yet. Do not skip a test to hide a failure.
